---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import SponsorList from "../components/SponsorList.astro";
import { fade } from "astro:transitions";
---

<MainLayout title="Sponsors">
  <div
    class="p-6 mb-7 text-slate-300 text-xl mx-6"
    transition:animate={fade({ duration: "0.4s" })}
  >
    <h1
      class="text-center text-4xl lg:text-5xl border-b-2 border-[#ABA1A1] py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-300 to-white text-transparent bg-clip-text mt-10"
    
    >
      Thank you to the Orlando Devs Sponsors
    </h1>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-8 py-10">
      <SponsorList />
    </div>
    <h1
      class="text-center text-3xl lg:text-4xl mt-2 mb-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-300 to-white text-transparent bg-clip-text"
    >
      Interested In Becoming a Sponsor?
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-slate-100 text-center mt-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      Orlando Devs thrives because of the generosity and support of our sponsors. Your partnership enables us to host events, provide resources, and foster a vibrant, inclusive tech community in Central Florida. We believe in building lasting relationships with organizations and individuals who share our passion for growth, learning, and connection.<br/><br/>
      Interested in supporting ODevs? Reach out to <strong><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/augustincaitlin/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Caitlin Augustin</a></strong> (President, VP of Product and Programs at DataKind) or <strong><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jacquesfu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jacques Fu</a></strong> (Treasurer, Founder at PETE Learning) to learn more about sponsorship opportunities and how you can make a difference. Together, we can continue to empower and inspire the next generation of Orlando's tech leaders!
    </p>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
